# Deploy & production (Render.com ONLY)

## Hard rule — remember this every turn

- **Весь SaaS-проект (saas-mvp-funnel) живёт на Render.com.** Не на Railway. Не на Netlify. Не на Vercel.
- Env / secrets / Polar / Firebase / webhooks / диски / логи — смотреть и править **только в Render**.
- **Запрещено:** `railway variables`, `railway up`, `railway logs`, Railway dashboard как «прод», копировать токены с Railway «потому что удобно».
- `railway.toml` в репо — наследие, **не** production path.

## Production

- **Site:** https://webstudio-muenchen.com (also https://saas-mvp-funnel.onrender.com)
- **Service id:** `srv-da1dg061egvs73ai5ubg`
- **Deploy:** `git push origin main` → Render auto-deploy from GitHub `main`
- After push: confirm `x-render-origin-server: Render`

## When user says «деплой» / «пуш»

1. Commit relevant code (no secrets). Do **not** stage deletions of `data/manifests/*` — see `never-delete-client-links.mdc`.
2. `git push origin main`
3. Confirm site responds with Render header

Render CLI may be unauthenticated; git push is enough when auto-deploy is on.

## Polar / ZIP / payments

- Configure `POLAR_*` on **Render** service env, not Railway.
- Never send SaaS €999 buyers to Factory SDK checkout success URL.
